      "message": "Using the canvas matrix instead of a local matrix to adjust where the src is drawn to allows the paint to produce the same pipeline as the main draw that fills most of the image.  Since the src was hopefully constructed to not require shader-based clamping, this lets us fill in a border of pixels around the main rescaled content with what would have been output by shader-based tiling a single larger draw call.",
