      "writtenOn": "2024-05-28T14:17:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Without this extra scope option, the bounds analysis would always trigger shader-based decaling because it would see that the scale factor !\u003d 1. But in this specific case, we actually assume that the linear interpolation scale matches the scale factor of the draw.",
      "range": {
